    "bio": {
      "pt": "A normalidade que mantém as portas abertas. Tudo nele parece funcionar — a gentileza é gesto certo no momento certo. Onde Orvian protege pelo peso, Maelik expõe pela ilusão.",
      "en": "The normalcy that keeps every door open. Everything about him seems to work — kindness delivered at the right moment. Underneath, the virus installed itself in an opening that was already there, and Maelik keeps normalizing what should be questioned. Where Orvian protects through weight, Maelik exposes through illusion."
    },
